                     <div class="videoNine clearfix">
                        <div class="related_post_sec single_post">
                           <h3></h3><ul><li>	<div class="rel_right">		<h3><a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_top_college_EducationInsiderMagazine.aspx">New Mexico Junior College Recognized as a Top Public Junior College for 2026</a></h3>		<div class="meta">			<span class="author">Author: <a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_top_college_EducationInsiderMagazine.aspx">Valerie Onsurez Gauna</a></span>			<span class="date">on: <a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_top_college_EducationInsiderMagazine.aspx">October 29, 2026</a></span>		</div>		<p>HOBBS, N.M. -- New Mexico Junior College (NMJC) has been recognized by Education Insider Magazine as a Top Public Junior College for 2026, highlighting the college's commitment to student success, accessible education, and workforce development.</p>	</div></li><li>	<div class="rel_right">		<h3><a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_skillsUSA_DC.aspx">NMJC SkillsUSA Students Attend National Leadership Conference in Washington, D.C.</a></h3>		<div class="meta">			<span class="author">Author: <a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_skillsUSA_DC.aspx">Emilee Jarrett</a></span>			<span class="date">on: <a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_skillsUSA_DC.aspx">October 29, 2026</a></span>		</div>		<p>Hobbs, NM -- Members of the New Mexico Junior College (NMJC) SkillsUSA chapter recently attended the Washington Leadership Training Institute (WLTI), a four-day national conference held each September in Washington, D.C. The event brings students and advisors from across the country together to develop leadership skills and advocate for skilled trades and career and technical education (CTE).</p>	</div></li><li>	<div class="rel_right">		<h3><a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_NMJC_WFD_DOE.aspx">NMJC Selected for Funding by Department of Energy</a></h3>		<div class="meta">			<span class="author">Author: <a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_NMJC_WFD_DOE.aspx">Valerie Onsurez Gauna</a></span>			<span class="date">on: <a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/news/2026_NMJC_WFD_DOE.aspx">October 29, 2026</a></span>		</div>		<p>NMJC has been selected as one of only eight organizations nationwide through a Department of Energy initiative.</p>	</div></li></ul></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-sm-4 col-xs-12">
                     <div class="list_block related_post_sec">
                        <div class="upcoming_events">
                           <h3>Upcoming Events</h3>
                           <ul id="events"><li class="related_post_sec single_post"><span class="date-wrapper"><span class="date"><span>20</span>November</span></span><div class="rel_right"><h4><a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/calendar/#event-details/d6e17579-0c95-4ada-9fea-57e34a7b97e1">Last Day to Withdraw (full & 2nd eight week sessions)</a></h4><div class="meta"><span class="event-time"><em class="fa fa-clock-o"></em> 12:00 AM</span></div></div></li><li class="related_post_sec single_post"><span class="date-wrapper"><span class="date"><span>22</span>November</span></span><div class="rel_right"><h4><a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/calendar/#event-details/12236d3b-e6c3-4ff9-9e59-d2b1f2a6b7d6">CLASSIC FILM SERIES -  The Nightmare before Christmas</a></h4><div class="meta"><span class="place"><em class="fa fa-map-marker"></em> Western Heritage Museum and Lea County Cowboy Hall of Fame</span><span class="event-time"><em class="fa fa-clock-o"></em> 2:00 PM</span></div></div></li><li class="related_post_sec single_post"><span class="date-wrapper"><span class="date"><span>23</span>November</span></span><div class="rel_right"><h4><a href="https://www.nmjc.edu/calendar/#event-details/5ee0ce0e-a84f-418d-8422-db7be1b5c99c">Thanksgiving Holiday (Campus Closed)</a></h4><div class="meta"><span class="event-time"><em class="fa fa-clock-o"></em> 12:00 AM</span></div></div></li></ul><a href="/calendar/index.aspx" class="btn btn-default btn-block commonBtn">More Events</a></div>
